 aria-description=\"Citation for case: Cooks v. State\">699 P. 2d 653</a></span>; No. 85-5308, <span class=\"citation multiple-matches\"><a href=\"/c/F.%202d/767/916/\">767 F. 2d 916</a></span>; No. 85-5310, <span class=\"citation multiple-matches\"><a href=\"/c/Ga./254/538/\">254 Ga. 538</a></span>, <span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"1211045\"><a href=\"/opinion/1211045/baxter-v-state/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Baxter v. State\">331 S. E. 2d 561</a></span>; No. 85-5477, <span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"1672533\"><a href=\"/opinion/1672533/harrell-v-state/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Harrell v. State\">470 So. 2d 1303</a></span>.</p>\n</opinion>"},{"id":9050324,"type":"dissent","typeCode":"040dissent","perCuriam":false,"author":"Brennanmarshall","joinedBy":"","pageCount":null,"textLength":594,"isHtml":true,"text":"<opinion type=\"dissent\">\n<author id=\"b801-10\">Justice Brennan and Justice Marshall,</author>\n<p id=\"AO5v\">dissenting.</p>\n<p id=\"AHsK\">Adhering to our views that the death penalty is in all circumstances cruel and unusual punishment prohibited by the Eighth and Fourteenth Amendments, <em>Gregg </em>v. <em>Georgia, </em><span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"9426555\"><a href=\"/opinion/109532/gregg-v-georgia/#227\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Gregg v. Georgia\">428 U. S. 153, 227, 231</a></span> (1976), we would grant certiorari and vacate the death sentences in these cases.</p>\n</opinion>"}],"citations":[]}